-- Being opened is not money passing through.
-- The late account only appears halfway through the chart and is never touched
-- again, so it belongs at the bottom next to everything else that never moves.
-- If its opening counted it would be the fastest-turning account here and go
-- on top, and the names sort that way too, so the order is the turnover.
currency USD 0.01

account assets:early
account assets:late
account equity
account expenses

2024-01-01
  | Opening early
  * assets:early +100 USD
  * equity       -100 USD

2024-01-03
  | Opening late
  * assets:late +100 USD
  * equity      -100 USD

2024-01-04
  | Spend from early
  * assets:early -1 USD
  * expenses     +1 USD
